<h2>This site</h2>

<p>
    Static HTML built with <a href="https://www.11ty.dev/">Eleventy</a> and served
    from <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/">Cloudflare</a>.
    No JavaScript and no cookies.
</p>

<p>
    I do count page views, but entirely on the server: for each request it
    stores the path, the referring site's hostname, the country and the status
    code, and nothing else. No IP addresses, no user agents, no identifiers, no
    third party &#8212; the numbers stay in my own Cloudflare account. Nothing
    is sent from your browser to collect them, and there's no way for me to
    tell one reader apart from another.
</p>

